{"rank": 132, "root": "جهد", "form": 3, "lemma": "جاهَدَ", "count": 27, "ayahCount": 26, "share": 0.14, "meaning": {"bs": "truditi se, boriti se", "en": "to strive, to struggle", "tr": "çalışmak, çaba göstermek", "fr": "s'efforcer, lutter", "id": "berjuang, bersungguh-sungguh", "ur": "کوشش کرنا، جدوجہد کرنا", "bn": "চেষ্টা করা, সংগ্রাম করা", "fa": "کوشیدن، جهاد کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/93db78cd8911f8d6cad7.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-jahada_3\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes jahada_3-m{from{transform:translate(-40px,14.3px)}}@keyframes jahada_3-ws{from{transform:rotate(-16deg)}}@keyframes jahada_3-wt{from{transform:rotate(16deg)}}.va-jahada_3 .ll{transform:rotate(16deg);animation:jahada_3-ws 0.5s ease-in-out 7 alternate both}.va-jahada_3 .rl{transform:rotate(-16deg);animation:jahada_3-wt 0.5s ease-in-out 7 alternate both}.va-jahada_3 .tr{transform:rotate(30deg)}.va-jahada_3 .ra,.va-jahada_3 .la{transform:rotate(-55deg)}.va-jahada_3 .gp{animation:jahada_3-m 3.5s linear both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-jahada_3.off,.va-jahada_3.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-jahada_3,.va-jahada_3 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M4 66L116 26\"/><g class=\"gp\"><circle class=\"q\" cx=\"77\" cy=\"31\" r=\"9\"/><g transform=\"translate(56 30)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "pas